{
  "_comment": "flashnext-2xtx KL, round 2: fp16 WMMA off / ahalf off were bit-identical (64-row KL steps take the large-lane GEMV). Arms: GEMV threshold at its floor (large-lane requests above 8 rows take the GEMM) / helper native kernels off. No control arm: it is deterministic (rad49-tail4g-kl-rep).",
